You may use, study, copy, modify and redistribute this software, including
your own forks, builds and derivative tools, free of charge, under two
conditions:

  1. Credit. You must credit Chrystian Farias and link back to this
     repository. A line such as:

         Based on CockpitTools by Chrystian Farias
         https://github.com/chrystianfarias/CockpitTools

     in the README, the mod description, the about screen, or the video
     description, is enough. Do not suggest that the author endorses you or
     your use of the work.

  2. No selling. You may not sell this software, in whole or in part. That
     includes selling access to it, bundling it with a paid product or
     service, putting it in paid mod packs, and paywalled or subscription
     distribution. Free public distribution, and use in videos or streams,
     are fine.

